  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan attacks a light yellow cloud covering a dream realm that holds Mutation Immortal Gu and Dancer Hong Yun. He reads it as a transformation path Gu formation with extraordinary defense and the ability to transport Gu Immortals, and guesses it is a portion of Reckless Savage’s true inheritance. Narration confirms it is the myriad li adaptation formation of that true inheritance, a genuine rank eight formation. Immortal Concubine Qing Lan notes the formation was reinforced to rank eight from a prior rank seven setup. Concubines teleport into the yellow cloud to reinforce it. When pressed, they activate a final method that emits golden rays and hardens the remnant cloud.",
      "chapters": [
        1872
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_mutation_immortal_gu",
        "char_dancer_hong_yun",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "inh_reckless_savage_true_inheritance",
        "char_immortal_concubine_qing_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later attacks the myriad li adaptation formation again while Thousand Transformations Ancestor is unwilling to show up, and uses the formation as cover while fighting.",
      "chapters": [
        1873
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_thousand_transformations_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The formation has a large size and cannot be moved once constructed, so Fang Yuan uses it as a shield against Heavenly Court attacks. Continuous assault shakes it until Wan Zi Hong’s killer move collapses a corner and reveals the space inside, where the defending female immortals suffer backlash.",
      "chapters": [
        1874
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immobile-shield",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_wan_zi_hong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Without Gu Immortals controlling it, the formation becomes a still target. Fang Yuan attacks it, tears it apart without self-destruction, and loots Immortal Gu inside before targeting the dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        1875
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "collapse-and-loot",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After it breaks, Thousand Transformations Ancestor treats borrowing Fang Yuan’s strength as the best way to leave the place.",
      "chapters": [
        1876
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
